A MIC basis based on random Bloch sphere affine transformation\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"786bf3fe-6395-4354-8803-2e771de8cc93"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"d3263c34-61e5-4580-9c0f-\
4700d0193853"],

Cell["\<\
Built-in names in the phase space that are not informationally complete, \
include:\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8c1be04c-b5bb-4164-a039-c2a97b230e96"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "eb631a7c-0139-4433-90df-683e19c2b718"], Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"03c84f39-9e78-4ce2-9697-0542e4e471fc"],
