     "a0559971-a04c-4fdc-bff7-1509098f49ee"], Cell[
    "basis of the Gell-Mann matrices", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "1a3eaddb-4b5b-49d5-9bbe-f7df0e9e6326"]},
