     "82ca834d-c81f-4c49-9edf-2bee47329935"], Cell["\<\
2-dimensional basis of the Wigner phase space operators with respect to the \
computational basis\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"45afe2ff-b18f-4089-bfe2-18a380dd2f48"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "946f4853-ee62-4fb4-bdcf-249002473fbb"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
